// `dyn Trait`: `&value` to a fat pointer `{ $data, $vt }`, calls through `$vt`, and `dyn Sub` to `dyn Super`
// upcasts through the `$up.Super` table entry (one indirect call, no allocation).
//
// Part of module j3c.lower.
// Port of: j3c/src/check/lower/dyn_call.rs, check/lower/dyn_up.rs
// J3: The table globals and their thunks are instances sema requests on its one queue when it types the
//     conversion (B11.2); lower only writes the pointer pair and the indirect call.
module j3c.lower;
